# Stable spec ID: punch-penicillin. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(Scotch whisky; blended @ ~Famous Grouse) 2 oz
(honey-ginger syrup) 3/4 oz
(lemon: juice, fresh) 3/4 oz
(Scotch whisky; single malt @ ~Laphroaig 10YO) 1/4 oz

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(rocks glass)

::instructions
<shake, blended Scotch and syrup and lemon juice with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<strain, into (rocks glass) over a large ice cube>
(Scotch whisky; single malt) <float, on top>
<garnish, with candied ginger>

::notes
This records one source-specific version; no universal formula or automatic product substitution is implied.
Syrup batch from the source: combine 1 cup honey, 1 cup water and a 6-inch piece of peeled sliced ginger. Bring to a boil, simmer 5 minutes, refrigerate overnight, then strain out the ginger. No source ratio basis is invented.

